"[actor] [page stabilization] add first paint callback to paintstability
monitor so that we start monitoring after the initial DOM reaction" (crbugs
580001415 and 573290593, not public): the actor's paint stability monitor
starts monitoring on the first paint within its start delay, not only when
the delay runs out. Not a security fix as far as the change shows, but it is
on the 157 branch, which the bleeding-edge build carries in full.
chromium/src main commit 4f79e3ed1417d894ae5d873be51d185a202b1b95
(main@{#1720926}), merged on 2026-11-04 to the 157 branch
(a721fda3541edba4e7c7ab0aae40972eca4a0cbc, refs/branch-heads/8103@{#1117},
after the 157.0.8103.45 tag). This is the 157 merge without its browser
test. Drop it once a 157 tag has it.

